  "description": "ECUCAI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H100 Cl2 Gd4 N8 O18 2+,2(Cl1 1-),2(C2 H6 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.569-3.921 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.88-110.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd4(L)2(HL)2(μ3-OH)2Cl2]·2Cl·2EtOH·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
